    <string name="settings_open_accessibility">Open accessibility settings</string>
    <string name="settings_restricted_title">“Restricted setting” blocked?</string>
    <string name="settings_restricted_body">Android 13+ blocks accessibility for apps installed outside the Play Store. If the switch is greyed out: open App info › ⋮ menu (top right) › “Allow restricted settings”, confirm, then come back and enable the service. On Android 15+ the option only appears after you have tried to enable the service once.</string>
